# ── Credential-bearing local scripts ────────────────────────────────────────
# These hardcode the production Neon connection string (user + password) inline
# instead of reading process.env.DATABASE_URL. They are currently UNTRACKED, but
# the repo root is full of stray files and a single `git add -A` would commit the
# production DB password to history permanently. Keep them out of the index.
# ACTION REQUIRED: rotate that Neon password and change these scripts to read
# from process.env before un-ignoring anything here.
set-admin.mjs
push-neon.mjs
*-neon.mjs

# Local operational logs (may contain emails / IPs / tokens)
cron.log
logs/
